..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : TEXTENCODER.SE
.. Author         : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Functionality  : Sets initially defaults of the mask buffer.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Defaults
.copy M|usedefaultmethod = G|true
.copy M|term4defaultencode = "+#X"
.copy M|term4defaultdecode = "-#X"
.copy M|term4transform = M|term4defaultencode
.copy M|term4retransform = M|term4defaultdecode
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
